---
import Layout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<Layout title="The studio" active="studio">
  <section class="wrap studio-hero">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Hello. We’re Idle Fusion.</span>
      <h1>
        Good work<br />starts with<br /><em>good people.</em>
      </h1>
      <p>
        I’m Matthew Strickland, founder of Idle Fusion. I’ve spent more than 20 years helping people
        turn ambitious ideas into useful digital products.
      </p>
      <p>
        From mobile experiences for Disney and NBC to independent apps for everyday life, the goal
        is the same: make technology feel simple, thoughtful, and worth using.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Let’s get to know your idea ↗</a>
    </div>
    <figure class="studio-portrait">
      <img
        src="/img/us/matthew.jpg"
        alt="Matthew Strickland, founder of Idle Fusion"
        width="768"
        height="1024"
      /><figcaption>
        <span>Matthew Strickland</span>
        <span>Founder & technology partner</span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>
  <section class="service-band">
    <div class="wrap values">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">How we work</span>
        <h2>
          Small studio.<br /><em>Considered</em><br />by design.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <article class="value-row">
          <h3>Direct by default.</h3>
          <p>
            A close working relationship with the person building your product. Clear conversations,
            shared context, and practical decisions.
          </p>
        </article><article class="value-row">
          <h3>Simple takes care.</h3>
          <p>
            The details matter because people feel them. We look for the clearest path through
            complexity and give it the attention it deserves.
          </p>
        </article><article class="value-row">
          <h3>Invested beyond launch.</h3>
          <p>
            Software keeps evolving. We value lasting partnerships and the steady improvements that
            make a good product better.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Always making</span>
        <h2>
          A builder’s curiosity.<br />An owner’s perspective.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p style="max-width:440px;font-size:15px">
        We build our own apps and share tools with other developers. That hands-on practice informs
        the care we bring to every client project.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="project-grid">
      <a class="apps-feature" style="display:block;margin:0" href="/apps/">
        <span class="eyebrow">In-house products</span>
        <h3>Small apps. Useful things.</h3>
        <p style="margin-top:18px">Purpose-built tools for health, focus, and everyday life.</p>
        <span class="text-link">Explore our apps ↗</span>
      </a>
      <a
        class="apps-feature"
        style="display:block;margin:0;background:#e8f5fc"
        href="/open-source/"
      >
        <span class="eyebrow">Open source</span>
        <h3>Good tools are worth sharing.</h3>
        <p style="margin-top:18px">Practical resources for the developer community.</p>
        <span class="text-link">See what we’re sharing ↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
